# VoiceVision Quality Gates
# Source: Makefile, pyproject.toml

## make check (AES Quality Gate)
- docs-check: VISION.md, PERSONAS.md, REQUIREMENTS.md, ROADMAP.md have required sections
- code-check: no TODO/FIXME in src/tests, src/voicevision exists
- test-check: pytest with --cov-fail-under=80
- lint-check: ruff check src tests, mypy --strict src, bandit src

## Ruff (pyproject.toml)
- line-length: 100
- target-version: py310
- select: E, F, W, I, UP, B, C4, C9, SIM, T20, PTH, ERA, RET, ARG
- ignore: S101, ARG001, ARG002
- per-file-ignores:
  - preflight.py: T201
  - listen.py: T201, C901
  - history.py: T201
  - server.py: T201
  - pipeline.py: C901

## MyPy (pyproject.toml)
- python_version: 3.10
- strict: true
- warn_return_any, warn_unused_configs, disallow_untyped_defs, etc.
- overrides: voicevision.platform.android ignored

## Bandit
- Security linting on src/

## Pre-commit
- Runs scripts/verify-implementation.sh on current ticket
- Requires all ACs checked [x]

## Coverage
- --cov=src/voicevision --cov-fail-under=80
- Current: ~87% (2646 statements, 348 missing)